1
00:06:07,058 --> 00:06:13,058
In every good, there is evil. In Holly Gooding
there is something worse. Much worse.

2
00:12:14,117 --> 00:12:20,117
Doppelganger is a horror, mystery, thriller film directed by Avi Nesher.

3
00:18:21,176 --> 00:18:27,176
After being implicated in a murder, a young woman flees New York City and
moves to Los Angeles, where she rents a room from a writer.

4
00:24:28,235 --> 00:24:34,235
They begin an affair, but it seems she's been followed
by a homicidal duplicate of herself.

5
00:30:35,294 --> 00:30:41,294
Holly Gooding, played by Drew Barrymore.

6
00:36:42,352 --> 00:36:48,352
Patrick Highsmith, played by George Newbern.

7
00:42:49,411 --> 00:42:55,411
Doctor Heller, played by Dennis Christopher.

8
00:48:56,470 --> 00:49:02,470
Elizabeth, played by Leslie Hope.

9
00:55:03,529 --> 00:55:09,529
Sister Jan, played by Sally Kellerman.

10
01:01:10,588 --> 01:01:16,588
Mike Wallace, played by George Maharis.

11
01:07:17,647 --> 01:07:23,647
Doppelganger (also known as Doppelganger: The Evil Within) is a 1993 American supernatural horror
thriller film written and directed by Avi Nesher, starring Drew Barrymore and George Newbern.

12
01:13:24,705 --> 01:13:30,705
The film premiered at the Avoriaz Fantastic Film Festival in January
1993, where it was nominated for the "Grand Prize" award.

13
01:19:31,764 --> 01:19:37,764
It was released on VHS on May 26, 1993 in the United States.

14
01:25:38,823 --> 01:25:44,823
This was George Maharis' final film before his death in May 2023.

15
01:31:45,882 --> 01:31:51,882
The film explores themes of nightmare, roommates, seduction, stalker, murder.

16
01:37:52,941 --> 01:37:58,941
The tone is intense and dark and mind_bending.
